  "description": "Updated entry targets, this week’s breakouts, and where the market stands now.",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Saturday! This is the weekly wrap up in case you missed anything. Monday through Thursday was pretty choppy in the markets, and we finally got some reversal signals on Friday. </p><h4>A bullish Friday, most often, indicates a bullish Monday and Tuesday. Not always…but often. </h4><p>If you missed any of these posts this week, they remain relevant today. We do not day trade, so never feel like you have to be first to a post, or get the exact entry into a stock like me. You can also swing by the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/eb3f00e6-9f30-4570-8e48-c0bde66e4eec\">Main Chat</a> and tag me if you have questions or want to verify if I think a stock is still in a “buy” territory. </p><h4><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-market-is-panicking-again-heres\">The 3 Stocks I am Targeting for Buys</a></strong></h4><ul><li><p><strong>I updated my entry targets after Friday’s reversal. Two are getting particularly close to price ranges I will buy. See my: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-market-reversed-here-are-my-3?r=4z8lgl\">Adjusted Entry Targets</a></strong></p></li></ul><h4><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-average-midweek-mover-stock-is?r=4z8lgl\">2 “Recession Resistant” Stocks Broke Out This Week</a></strong></h4><ul><li><p>Both the 1st and 2nd place stocks are still in buy range. </p></li></ul><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">What The StockTok Screener is showing</a>…</h4><ul><li><p>The screener has been giving Frontline since February, and FRO is now up 63% since then. The original SEPA entry has passed, but another stock just triggered and looks much more actionable here.</p><p></p></li></ul><p>Also, this weeks community Stock was CRV Energy, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;CVI&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. CVI rose 23% this week, and the question has come up: “Is this still good?” This was a fresh break out on the weekly and monthly charts, so though I expect some consolidations at some point, I think long term, it still has runway ahead of it.  </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary button-wrapper\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZFNK!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3785429c-cd75-4f5c-9353-7a29bcc4adb1_1407x926.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZFNK!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3785429c-cd75-4f5c-9353-7a29bcc4adb1_1407x926.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZFNK!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3785429c-cd75-4f5c-9353-7a29bcc4adb1_1407x926.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZFNK!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3785429c-cd75-4f5c-9353-7a29bcc4adb1_1407x926.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZFNK!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3785429c-cd75-4f5c-9353-7a29bcc4adb1_1407x926.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/